          "segment": null,
          "value": "Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "For more information on this tour contact your Group Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOnce you have received your Confirmation and Invoice, you can pay your final balance.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "4ac29388-3de3-458c-92c4-67ae586be2b2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELacock Abbey, Fox Talbot Museum \u0026amp; Village\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScenic Drive through the Wye Valley\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETintern Abbey\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETredegar House\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECardiff \u0026amp; Cardiff Bay \u2013 guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESenedd, National Assembly Building\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECardiff Castle \u2013 guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDyffryn Gardens\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESt Fagans National Museum of History\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESS Great Britain \u0026amp; Being Brunel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c4b3a613-0d2c-4470-8d06-f7efea52d6e0",
      "key": "431e9307-d1d6-4cbb-b660-82d77605cc48",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "In this page"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyNavigationInPageItems",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "e988feb8-2c96-4b89-a9f6-e91f3b501a70",
            "ecb4fc2b-5111-4414-b602-09c17decda43",
            "d88f9210-91bb-4ba1-afdc-7681675efea5",
            "4ac29388-3de3-458c-92c4-67ae586be2b2",
            "589435d2-09e8-464a-8e30-49d4a7f3511a",
            "7c288a17-654e-42d5-b5d7-9c8d1918f0ae",
            "e7f50cd1-8f0f-47cb-8976-6acec760716f"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "e988feb8-2c96-4b89-a9f6-e91f3b501a70",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe board our executive coach and depart from our designated pick up points. En route to our hotel we visit the National Trust\u2019s Lacock Abbey, Fox Talbot Museum and Village in Wiltshire. Founded in 1232, many parts of this fine abbey have survived largely intact and the Victorian woodland garden includes an 18th century summer house and rose garden. We continue to the 4* St Pierre Marriott Hotel and Country Club on the outskirts of Chepstow for a four night stay on a half board basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe enjoy a scenic drive through the Wye Valley with our Blue Badge guide this morning. During our tour we see the remains of Tintern Abbey. Tintern Abbey is the best preserved abbey in Wales and ranks among Britain\u2019s most beautiful historic sites. Turner sketched and painted here, whilst Wordsworth drew inspiration from the surroundings. This afternoon we visit Tredegar House near Newport. Set in a beautiful 90 acre park, this is one of the best examples of a 17th century Charles II mansion in Britain, the earliest surviving part of which dates back to the early 1500\u2019s.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith our Blue Badge guide this morning we have a guided tour of Cardiff. Our guided tour includes a visit to the Senedd, the National Assembly Building, and the exterior of the Norwegian Sailor\u2019s Church, established in 1868 to provide religious and social care to thousands of Norwegian sailors that were employed in the Norwegian merchant fleet. During our tour, we also see the exterior of the Wales Millennium Centre. Opened in 2004 and locally known as \u2018the Armadillo\u2019, the centre is home to the national orchestra and opera, dance, theatre and literature companies. This afternoon we enjoy a guided tour of Cardiff Castle which explores a history spanning nearly 2,000 years and introduces us to the lavish interiors created by William Burges for the 3rd Marquess of Bute.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur Blue Badge guide meets us at our hotel this morning and accompanies us throughout the day. This morning we visit the National Trust\u2019s Dyffryn Gardens. Set in the heart of the Vale of Glamorgan countryside, the 55 acre gardens are the result of a unique collaboration between the eminent landscape architect, Thomas Mawson, and the passionate plant collector, Reginald Corey. We continue to the St Fagans National Museum of History, the 2019 Art Fund Museum of the Year. Set in 100 acres of parkland, with over forty original buildings, the Museum shows how the people of Wales have lived, worked and spent their leisure time over the last five hundred years.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter checking out of our hotel and en route home we visit Brunel\u2019s SS Great Britain, the world\u2019s first great ocean liner and explore the beautifully recreated First Class Dining Saloon, steerage quarters and new Engine Room. During our visit we have time to visit Being Brunel, a newly opened attraction that contemplates the life and legacy of Isambard Kingdom Brunel. Taking carefully selected comfort stops en route, we return back to our original pick up points.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ENB:- Please note we reserve the right to alter the above itinerary if required for operational\nreasons. Given the historic nature of the places visited, a certain degree of walking will be involved, and this tour may not be suitable for those with mobility problems.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
